Jx=e4,kJy=[0,b8,[0,g,e4]],kJz="\nToggles the statics refractor on or off for the bindings at the given paths (same behavior as the editor statics toggle).\nCollapsed definitions are auto-expanded when statics end up enabled.\n\nParameters:\npaths: list(string) \xe2\x80\x94 paths to the bindings to toggle\n",kJA=[0,[0,k$,[0,T,[0,[0,b8,[0,g,jL]],[0,[0,kj,[0,T,[0,[0,ln,[0,T,[0,pyd,pyc]]],0]]],[0,[0,hI,[0,h,[0,[0,g,ln],0]]],0]]]]],0],kJB=dV,kJC=[0,bg,[0,g,bfM]],kJD=e4,kJE=[0,b8,[0,g,e4]],kJF=[0,0,0],kJP=[0,1],kJO=H,kJN=H,kJM=H,kJL=m,kJK=cC,kJJ="Printer.add_indent: Not_found",kJQ=[0,m],kJR=[0,ij],kJT=[0,"- **checkbox** \xe2\x80\x94 Toggle UI for boolean literals."],kJU=[0,"- **slider** \xe2\x80\x94 Numeric literal editor (integer)."],kJV=[0,"- **sliderf** \xe2\x80\x94 Numeric literal editor (floating-point)."],kJW=[0,"- **card** \xe2\x80\x94 **Playing-card** editor: a tuple `(Suit, Rank)` such as `(Hearts, Ace)` or a list of those tuples. **Not** for records, modules, or `{ let \xe2\x80\xa6; \xe2\x80\xa6 }` blocks."],kJX=[0,"- **livelit** \xe2\x80\x94 Custom livelit projector for structured literal editing."],kJY=[0,"- **text** \xe2\x80\x94 Multiline string literal editor."],kJZ=[0,"- **table** \xe2\x80\x94 Spreadsheet-style editor for a **list of labeled tuples** sharing the same labels; the labels become column headers. Attaches off the **elaborated** form, so it can apply where the surface syntax alone is not yet a table."],kJ0=[0,"- **csv** \xe2\x80\x94 CSV **file import** UI. Attaches only when the definition is the **empty list** `[]`; after placement, import fills it with row/tuple syntax. Non-empty lists (e.g. `[1, 2, 3]`) **cannot** take this projector."],kJ1=[0,0,0],kJ2=[0,m,[0,"These are alternative UIs for literals and structured values that may already appear in code.",0]],kJ3=[0,"### Livelits (menu projectors)",0],kJ5=[0,m,0],kJ6=[0,m,[0,"### Syntax projector tools (Filbert)",[0,"`place_syntax_projector(kind, paths)`, `remove_syntax_projector(paths)`, and `toggle_syntax_projector(kind, paths)` apply **syntax projector** UIs to the term selected by each path.",[0,"`kind` must be a menu projector name (`fold`, `slider`, `sliderf`, `check`, `text`, `card`, `csv`, `table`, `livelit`) \xe2\x80\x94 not `probe` or `statics` (those use the probe/statics tools).",[0,m,[0,"**CRITICAL \xe2\x80\x94 livelits are not automatic:** Ordinary Hazel code (`let speed = 50`, `let is_active = true`, list literals, records) renders as **plain text** until you call **`place_syntax_projector`**.",[0,'If the user asks how livelits work, or wants sliders/checkboxes/CSV editors/text boxes, you **must** call `place_syntax_projector` with the right `kind` on each binding path (e.g. `slider` on `"speed"`, `check` on `"is_active"`, `text` on `"message"`, `csv` only when the RHS is `[]`, `card` only on playing-card tuples/lists\xe2\x80\x94see livelit lines above; nested paths like `"config/volume"`).',[0,"**Never** describe interactive widgets as present based only on `insert_*`, `update_*`, or other edit tools \xe2\x80\x94 that is false unless the matching `place_syntax_projector` calls succeeded.",[0,m,0]]]]]]]]],kJ7=j7(["## Projectors and the agent view",m,"### Fold (`\xe2\x8b\xb1`)","A **fold** is a collapsed definition in the GUI: the definition shows as `\xe2\x8b\xb1` (not source text).","Use `expand` / `collapse` (see **Paths** and **View Tools** above).",m,"### Runtime probe refractor","The **probe** refractor attaches to a binding and shows evaluated values in the agent view (e.g. `expr \xe2\x89\xa1 value`).","Tools: `place_probe`, `remove_probe`, `toggle_probe`.",m,"### Statics refractor (type overlay)","The **statics** refractor shows a type ascription overlay in the GUI (offside type cell) for human clarity.","It does not change program text; the agent\xe2\x80\x99s printed context may not mirror the overlay unless printing is extended.",m]),kJ9=[0,"**Projectors**: **Folds** display as `\xe2\x8b\xb1` (collapsed defs; expand/collapse in the full prompt).",[0,"**Refractors** overlay bindings: **probes** show runtime values (`\xe2\x89\xa1` in context); **statics** add a type overlay in the GUI.",[0,"**Livelits** are alternate UIs for literals (checkbox, slider/sliderf, text, card, csv, table, livelit, plus fold in the menu).",[0,"**Agent tools**: `place_syntax_projector` / `remove_syntax_projector` / `toggle_syntax_projector` (see full prompt).",[0,"Full detail lives in Filbert\xe2\x80\x99s live system prompt **Projectors and the agent view** section (this excerpt may be truncated).",0]]]]],kKd=[0,m],kKc="Editor.Meta.t_of_yojson",kKb="Editor.Meta.yojson_of_t",kKa="Editor.Meta.t_of_sexp",kJ_="Editor.Meta.sexp_of_t",kKk=[0,0,[0,1,[0,2,[0,3,0]]]],kKj=[0,0,[0,1,[0,2,[0,3,0]]]],kKl=[0,0,[0,1,[0,2,[0,3,0]]]],kKi=[0,"Empty hole"],kKh=gb,kKg=[0,"Missing operator"],kKe=[0,0,1],kKf=[0,0,0],kKm=[0,[0,k$,[0,T,[0,[0,b8,[0,g,jL]],[0,[0,kj,[0,T,[0,[0,ln,[0,T,[0,pyf,pye]]],0]]],[0,[0,hI,[0,h,[0,[0,g,ln],0]]],0]]]]],0],kKn=dV,kKo=[0,bg,[0,g,biH]],kKp=e4,kKq=[0,b8,[0,g,e4]],kKr=[0,[0,k$,[0,T,[0,[0,b8,[0,g,jL]],[0,[0,kj,[0,T,[0,[0,ln,[0,T,[0,pyh,pyg]]],0]]],[0,[0,hI,[0,h,[0,[0,g,ln],0]]],0]]]]],0],kKs=dV,kKt=[0,bg,[0,g,bgb]],kKu=e4,kKv=[0,b8,[0,g,e4]],kKw=[0,[0,k$,[0,T,[0,[0,b8,[0,g,jL]],[0,[0,kj,[0,T,[0,[0,ln,[0,T,[0,pyj,pyi]]],0]]],[0,[0,hI,[0,h,[0,[0,g,ln],0]]],0]]]]],0],kKx=dV,kKy=[0,bg,[0,g,beB]],kKz=e4,kKA=[0,b8,[0,g,e4]],kKQ=[0,1],kKN=[0,K1],kKO=[0,H],kKP=cC,kKL=[0,40],kKK=[0,kT],kKM=m,kKJ=[0,0],kKE=[0,1],kKF=[0,m],kKG=[0,ij],kKH=H,kKI=cC,kKB=bhk,kKC=dxg,kKD=bUm,kKR=[0,0],kKT=[0,fo,[0,pO,[0,eq,0]]],kKW=[0,0],kK5="no note",kK6="mod-root wrap did not yield a single module body",kK7="root sort is not fast-parseable (Exp and Mod only)",kKZ=[0,i0],kK0=[0,iC],kK1=iC,kK3=[0,az],kK2=dj,kK4=az,kKY="segment expects a hole but source tokens are exhausted",kKX="Haz3lcore.FastParse.Mismatch",kLh=[0,0,0],kLe=[0,0,0],kLf=[0,[0,0,0],[0,1,0]],kLg=[0,1],kLb=[0,AC,[0,B3,0]],kLc=[0,kI,[0,lp,0]],kLd=[0,dj,[0,az,0]],kLa=[0,0],kK$=[0,0],